<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine monthly grain/oilseed shipments.</title>
<headline>Argentine monthly grain/oilseed shipments.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat December grain shipment figures (tonnes), followed by January-December totals (year-earlier in brackets).</p>
<p> Wheat    1,862,965  (638,888)     5,832,725  (6,780,796)</p>
<p> Maize	270,489  (124,826)     7,031,007  (6,041,086)</p>
<p> Sorghum	  nil	 100	  665,804    (183,505)</p>
<p> Barley	   nil	(nil)	   6,888     (21,400)</p>
<p> Soybeans	  77	 257	2,114,360  (2,608,266)</p>
<p> Sunseed	  580    (3,229)	 537,954    (827,618)</p>
<p> Others	 6,158   (41,631)	 267,802    (273,165)</p>
<p>Principal destinations in December were as follows (tonnes):  </p>
<p>WHEAT: Brazil 416,623; Turkey 180,730; Tunisia 104,751; Morocco 141,732; Egypt 113,270</p>
<p>MAIZE: Chile 16,925; Britain 27,754; Iran 135,210; Peru 38,423; Colombia 12,812.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
